WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.088
Now the alert.

2
00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:05.758
The query has three legs: interactive
sign-ins, non-interactive sign-ins,

3
00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:10.349
and audit events where an emergency
account is the actor or the target.

4
00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:14.973
It deliberately doesn't use a fuzzy
union, because if a table never arrives,

5
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:18.762
a fuzzy union returns nothing,
and silence looks like safety.

6
00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:23.248
The template keeps Learn's settings,
severity zero and any result fires,

7
00:00:23.248 --> 00:00:27.125
and checks that it points at a
real workspace and action group.

8
00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:30.625
It deploys nothing; that's
the reviewed pipeline's job.

9
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.870
And remember the two prerequisites:

10
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:36.220
the logs have to be sent, and
the license has to be there.
